Task 3. Using Bisection Method and Newton-Raphson method, find the root of the function
f(x) = x^3 -28 with accuracy at least 1%. Start with x0 = 2.
Algorithm (NR)
define f(x) = x^3 - 28
define f’(x) = 3 x^2
input x					# input the initial root estimate
input Tolerance   			# input the tolerance (required accuracy)
do
Error = f(x) / f’(x)		# the error estimate
output x, Error			# output current estimates
if ( |Error| < Tolerance ) 
terminate 				# terminate if tolerance is satisfied
x = x – Error				# subtract the error estimate

